From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] glm5: fold the indexer weight scale into the decode FWHT quant

VLLM_GLM5_DECODE_IDX_GLUE (default 0; sm_80 only). Port of the "fwht"
and "expand" items of Morrowmake's ampere_decode/idx_glue.py
(ops/idx_glue.py): for bf16 contiguous Q with <= 4096 rows and a
power-of-two weight scale, one Triton launch does the FWHT, the FP8 quant
and the indexer weight scaling (replacing fwht128_quant_fp8 +
_fused_indexer_weight_scale), and the kpool indexer expands pool ids in one
launch. FP8 encoding uses the baseline encoder (v1/attention/ops/fp8_sm80),
not the MM-only triton_e4m3 module. GPU-verified bit-identical.

diff --git a/vllm/model_executor/layers/sparse_attn_indexer_kpool.py b/vllm/model_executor/layers/sparse_attn_indexer_kpool.py
index 4701b62..4e25072 100644
--- a/vllm/model_executor/layers/sparse_attn_indexer_kpool.py
+++ b/vllm/model_executor/layers/sparse_attn_indexer_kpool.py
@@ -448,7 +448,19 @@ def sparse_attn_indexer_kpool(
                     scale_fmt,
                 )
 
-    topk_indices_buffer[: hidden_states.shape[0]] = -1
+    from vllm.models.glm5next.nvidia.ops import idx_glue
+
+    glue_direct = (
+        idx_glue.enabled() and has_decode and not has_prefill
+        and index_kpool > 1 and positions is not None
+        and attn_metadata_narrowed.decode is not None
+        and not attn_metadata_narrowed.decode.requires_padding
+        and attn_metadata_narrowed.max_seq_len > topk_tokens
+        and topk_indices_buffer.dtype == torch.int32
+        and topk_indices_buffer.stride(1) == 1
+    )
+    if not glue_direct:
+        topk_indices_buffer[: hidden_states.shape[0]] = -1
     if has_prefill:
         prefill_metadata = attn_metadata_narrowed.prefill
         assert prefill_metadata is not None
@@ -933,6 +945,14 @@ def sparse_attn_indexer_kpool(
                     select_k,
                 )
 
+        # Same pool writes/top-k, only the final data movement is folded.
+        # Width is physical (typically 2176), never logical topk_tokens=2048.
+        if glue_direct:
+            idx_glue.expand_pools_into_buffer(
+                pool_topk, positions, topk_indices_buffer,
+                hidden_states.shape[0], index_kpool)
+            return topk_indices_buffer
+
         # Resolve to token-level indices in the output buffer.
         if index_kpool > 1:
             pool_ids = pool_topk.to(torch.int64)
diff --git a/vllm/models/glm5next/nvidia/attention.py b/vllm/models/glm5next/nvidia/attention.py
